{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_vendla_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_vendla_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"新东西","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"玛格达尔帮助了一位战后不愿再走出门的病人——用药物，也用鲜花。她也因此将花房重建的事提上了日程。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_vendla_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["面带愁容的女士","玛格达尔","贝琳","鬼鬼祟祟的男子","帕特尔","屋里含糊的吼声","老哈利","门内的怒吼","窗外的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"charslot","id":4},{"type":"image","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":7},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":8},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_43_g7_towngreenhouse.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"玛格达尔很难说清自己对花的喜爱从何处来。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"也许源于幼时带去学校的花收获到的赞叹，或是父母手把手教她修剪枝叶时的温情、与祖父边逛种子市场边吃雪糕的快乐......","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"乃至于后来，坐在花房里，看着孩童给母亲挑花的童真，小伙给爱人买花的羞涩，新妇为装点家里购买花朵时的憧憬......","id":13},{"type":"text","text":"她喜爱与花相随的这一切温暖而安逸的感觉，她曾相信这便是生活该有的样子。","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":20},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"animtext","id":24,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>维多利亚，重建中的布伦特伍德镇 </><p=2>1099年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":25},{"type":"animtextclean","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面带愁容的女士","text":"玛格达尔......你有空吗？这是，新鲜的南瓜派，给你带的。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"贝琳，你不用这样。是你父亲的问题吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"嗯......三番两次麻烦你上门，太不好意思了。你就收下吧。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"他这两天更糊涂了，说实话，我都有点怕他了。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"他还是不肯出门？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"越来越严重了，本来只是不让开窗，现在连开门进屋都要大惊小怪。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"今天早上，我进屋的时候，迎面就看到他举着锄头要扑过来......幸好后来他认出是我。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"太危险了......他的身体怎么样了？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"他那死倔的脾气，疼也不会喊的。但最近他肚子右边的皮肤摸起来硬硬的，我怕结晶有扩散。想麻烦你上门看看......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"再怎么怨，他也是自己老爹......要不是经历了那种事，他也不会变成这样的。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"好......你稍等，我准备一下，马上就去。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"好了，贝琳，我们走吧。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"呀，玛格达尔，这花......不行，不能要你的。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"你自己的花房被毁成这样，还让出来给我们当诊室用。你好不容易种点花，我们怎么能要？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我知道花对你来说，就像农田对老爹，都是感情的寄托......可惜他现在，连自家门口的农田也不愿意再看一眼了。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"带上吧。我现在每天在诊室忙都忙不过来，也没什么时间照料花，带给你父亲，正好给我减减负。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"他以前......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"玛格达尔本想说老人以前常来自己的花房散步，但收住了话头。","id":76},{"type":"text","text":"那时老人是跟自己的妻子携手来的，如今既无花房，那位老太太也已过世。","id":77},{"type":"text","text":"她听说老人的妻子正是在家门口的农田遇害的。老人目睹了惨剧后便神志糊涂了，即便是萨卡兹已经离开好几个月后的如今也没有清醒。","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"就当是去探望朋友，让我带上这盆花吧。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"贝琳家门口本有一片料理得十分齐整的农田。耕种既是老人的生计，也是老人的骄傲，老人从不容许别人践踏他的农田。","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"可如今，玛格达尔看到那片田里全是荒草。更有甚者，经历了萨卡兹破坏的屋子都还没有修缮过，连屋檐都掉下了半边。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鬼鬼祟祟的男子","text":"（悄声）贝琳、贝琳，我在这儿。我给你带了烤蛋糕。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（悄声）啊，你来了。抱歉，帕特尔，我请了玛格达尔来给老爹做检查，今天不能陪你。你先回去吧。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"（悄声）玛格达尔。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（迟疑地放低音量）你......好？我们需要这样小声吗？是你的父亲在睡觉？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（悄声）不是。是老爹和帕特尔有点......小误解。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"是小误解。见自己的未婚妻却能体验偷情的刺激。惊喜吧~","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"帕特尔！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屋里含糊的吼声","text":"谁在外面！","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（提高声音）爸爸，是我！我请了玛格达尔过来，我们马上进来。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屋里含糊的吼声","text":"还有谁、谁在外面！","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"没有了，只有我们两个。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（悄声）发生什么了，贝琳？你和帕特尔不是早就打算结婚了，在“他们”来之前？你父亲不是很欣赏帕特尔吗？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"是啊，那时候我未来的老丈人还没发现我是个入侵者、战争犯、杀人狂——","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（悄声）帕特尔！你赶紧回去吧，老爹今天情况特别不好。我的头也一直在痛，不想跟你吵。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"那，这......算了，当我没来过吧。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"......我们进屋去吧，玛格达尔。这些事......不谈也罢。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（快速关上门）爸爸，我们进来了。是我和玛格达尔，你别怕。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，最近身体感觉怎么样？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"屋内门窗紧闭，空气浑浊。刚才还在吼叫的老人，这会儿正愣愣地蜷缩在一把摇椅里。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"他埋头检视着一只打开的木匣子，翻找着什么。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，我先来帮你采血。我可以帮你把匣子放在一边吗？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"你连这也要抢？该死的魔族佬！松手！我死也不会给你！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"唔！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"抱歉......我只是想帮你采血。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"玛格达尔，没事吧？有没有撞到哪里？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"爸爸！你怎么可以推人？你看看清楚，她是玛格达尔，她要来帮你看矿石病！","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"贝琳......贝琳，我没事，我们先安抚他的情绪，避免对他大喊大叫。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"天天这样，我已经......好吧，他认不出你来的，还是我来固定他的手吧。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"别碰我！少了一样，少了！少了！全都被魔族佬抢走了！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（摇头）不能强行来，这样采血容易伤到他。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（柔声）老哈利，就这样不要动，抱紧你的匣子，好吗？现在我要用酒精棉球擦拭你的胳膊，有点凉，不怕。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（替他手臂消毒）对，冷静下来，也不要看我的针。说说看，你匣子里的是什么？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"是......我的旧顶针......孩子妈妈的青金石项链......从劳伦家借来的手帕......还少一样......一样新东西。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（将采血针刺入静脉）啊，原来是四样东西，给贝琳结婚准备的？你接着说，怎么会少了一样新东西，去哪儿了？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"被......魔族佬夺走了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"......魔族佬已经走了，老哈利。他们夺走了我们很多东西，但那已经是过去的事了。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"你看，我给你带什么了？你以前很喜欢鸢尾的，它现在就是这个屋里的新东西，不是吗？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"老哈利两眼发直地望着那盆色彩鲜艳的花。玛格达尔再对他说什么，都换不来回应了。","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"今天辛苦你了，玛格达尔。他的情况怎么样？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"具体的情况得看报告。但是，你在他肚子上摸到的，恐怕确实是扩散的结晶。这样的发展速度......","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"他似乎一直在期盼着你的婚礼......你和帕特尔究竟......","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"你觉得，他还能撑多久？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"我们去屋外说。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":204},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"啊......！我不是在偷听！","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"魔族佬......还敢上我家来！我的锄头呢......我打死你个魔族佬！","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"玛格达尔，快出来。把门关上！","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorbreak","volume":"0.8","id":212},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"帕特尔！你在门外做什么！我不是让你回去吗！","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"我......谁知道你们突然开门了！","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门内的怒吼","text":"贝琳！快进来！","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"别吼了，跟你说了多少遍了，不是所有长了角的人都是魔族佬，他是帕特尔，他是你未来的女婿！","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门内的怒吼","text":"别想带走我的女儿！！！","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（突然痛哭）我受够了，真是......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"贝琳......来这边坐一会儿，手帕。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"好啦，别怪帕特尔了。他好不容易为你烤了蛋糕，想把它留在门口给你。对吗，帕特尔？","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"......我为我刚才的口吻道歉。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"你父亲见到帕特尔的反应......这就是你们的婚礼延迟的原因吗？","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（抽泣）我知道这不是他的错，也不是老爹的错......可这难道是我的错吗？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"这当然不是你的错。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"老爹......本来很喜欢帕特尔。但是......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"妈妈出事那天，只有老爹在。就在老爹最珍惜的这片田里，妈妈的血还留在那里......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我不知道老爹当时看到了什么，但他一定深深记住了魔族佬的那对角。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"从此以后他就糊涂了，只要看到任何长角的人，他就会发狂大叫。到后来，他变得不敢出门，连窗也都要封起来。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"他就是害怕记起那天的事......但越是害怕，他越是一遍遍提醒自己那天发生了什么......他把自己留在了那一天里。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我知道你提起婚礼是想提醒我，他已经没多少时间了。可是，这个婚礼真的还能在他面前举行吗？玛格达尔，你说呢？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":262},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"玛格达尔......又是我。那天......谢谢你。这是帕特尔烤的曲奇饼。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（摇头）没事的。你父亲的体检报告已经整理好了，给。有其他我帮得上忙的地方，也请说。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"其实......真的有。你上次坚持送给老爹的那盆鸢尾，你还记得吗？你说那是给我结婚用的“新东西”，老爹他，喜欢得不得了。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"他总是望着那盆花发呆，情绪也比先前平静一些了。但是......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"花谢了？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（为难地点头）他变本加厉地大喊大叫......我实在，不想问你讨要你的花的。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"贝琳，花只是花，最重要的，还是喜欢它的人。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"我一直觉得，人们收到花后的快乐，才是我最喜欢的。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"谢谢你，玛格达尔......","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"幸好那天我看他很喜欢，后来又特地去买了几盆成花。这些不仅够他看的，连做花环都足够了......啊。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"对了，你说你父亲不想看到帕特尔的那对角，因为那对角会让他想起萨卡兹来。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"那如果，我们试着改变他对那对角的印象呢？","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我们试过戴帽子，遮住那对角。他冲上去就把帽子扯下来，然后就闹得一塌糊涂。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"嗯......我不太确定，我是说，改变他的印象。比如，给帕特尔戴上农事节的花环，这是只属于我们小镇的回忆。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"以前，每年农事节前都有编不完的花环，我忙得觉都来不及睡，镇上好多人都会来帮忙，你父亲也帮过我的。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"那样的日子......花房里总是充满笑声，或许，他会记得呢......我只是一说，或许我想得太简单了。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"......可以帮忙编一个花环吗，我想试一试。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":304},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","channel":"1","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glassbroken","channel":"1","id":310},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"我打死你个臭不要脸的魔族佬！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"我们的农事节！我们的农事节都被你们毁了！","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"我......我这就走，你别打了！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":324},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"嘶......这角要是真被他砸断了，也就没那么多麻烦了。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"没事吧，哪里受伤没？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_498_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特尔","text":"有，很痛。心里痛。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_498_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"......","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"抱歉......都是我出的坏主意。我怎么会想不到......你父亲一想到农事节，只会更怨恨萨卡兹。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"这不是你的坏主意，是我们两个都想尝试的。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"如果我幸福起来就能让他找到他丢掉的东西，哪怕只有那么一会儿，我也想要努力争取......","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"他丢掉的东西......是什么呢。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"我们会不会关注错了方向？","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我想他丢掉的，是曾经最重视的......人，和事物。妈妈，农田，现在他不想丢掉我。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"所以，我们应该关注的不是那对角！","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"嗯！我们也许可以试试，关注他丢掉的东西。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"可是，我很担心我们会再次弄巧成拙......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"不会比现在更糟糕了。你有什么主意，请告诉我！","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":361},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":365,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，是我。我来探望你了。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"今天给你带了烤饼干，味道熟悉吗？是你的准女婿烤的。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"准......女婿......","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"啊......外面是什么声音！有人！","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"是风，老哈利，风把种子吹得满地都是。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"种子......现在是......什么季节了......","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"只要想种，什么季节都能播种的。再寒的冬天，我们也都撑过来了，不是吗？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":389},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"dialog","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#10$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，又是我。今天给你带的是你准女婿烤的鳞肉派。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"外面的声音......总是有......你一来就有声音！","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"怎、怎么会呢。外面是风的声音。","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"又是风？你骗我！","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"是......是种子发芽了，风吹得枝叶互相碰撞的声音。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"枝叶......外面那片田里......只有......啊啊啊！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"一提及门外那片田，老人痛苦地抱住了头。","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（轻声）......种子是很顽强的，老哈利。无论在怎样的土地上，种子总会破土而出的。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":414},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":415},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":418},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":423},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，我来了。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"又来了......外面有人在跑来跑去，在忙什么！你是不是想说，还是风！","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"你亲眼看看，好吗？我今天来，是想请你看看你的窗外的。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"窗外......是......","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"不、不能开窗。不能向外看。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"我向你保证，只打开窗瞄一眼，如果你不喜欢，我们马上关上，好吗？","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"charslot","id":439},{"type":"text","text":"老哈利一脸厌恶，玛格达尔越是劝，他越是恐惧地后退，抗拒着这个想法。他不能去想窗外有什么，不能去想那里发生过什么。","id":440},{"type":"text","text":"玛格达尔沮丧地拍拍手上的泥土。看来，这一次也算是白忙了。就算努力了这么多时日，也无法劝老人向窗外看一眼。","id":441},{"type":"dialog","id":442},{"type":"charslot","id":443},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"窗外的声音","text":"啊啊啊！","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"啊，外面，怎么了！","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"贝琳不要怕！爸爸来了！","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":450},{"type":"charslot","id":451},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":453},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":455},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":456},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","volume":"1","id":457},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":458},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorbreak","volume":"1","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":461},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"老人毫不犹豫地冲出了久未踏出的屋门，被屋外的阳光刺得睁不开眼。然而，当他看清门口发生的事时，他一时愣住了神。","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"dialog","id":465},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":466},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"门口的那片爱人倒下的、染了血的农田里，不知何时种满了花。","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"绿油油的枝叶与花苞中，有一朵鸢尾开花了，他的女儿与未婚夫兴奋地拥抱在一起。","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"爸爸！","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"charslot","id":473},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":474,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"老人一步步走向农田。看到老人走来，女儿的未婚夫流露出怯意，生怕自己的角碍了他的眼。","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"爸爸，你看，这片农田还没有荒废，在这里种的花还能开的。","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"我们以为这里荒了这么久，花又是移植来的，或许成活不了。玛格达尔每次来探望你的时候，都会教我们照料这些花。","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"（含泪）你看它......真的开了。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"老哈利，抱歉，擅作主张了......如果你不喜欢，我们就......","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"老人走进田里，却并不去看花，而是蹲下身，抓起一把土。粗糙的手指轻捻，泥土从指缝掉落。","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"那天......她想来田里收红薯。战争不知道什么时候才能结束，她怕家里会断粮......","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"我如果，拦住她就好了......","id":490,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":491},{"type":"charslot","id":492},{"type":"text","text":"在老人的啜泣声中，玛格达尔看到，那时没有收的作物残留了腐烂的茎叶，与泥土融为一体。花正是开在这样的泥土里的。","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","focus":"m","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老哈利","text":"......匣子，我的匣子......","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"在这里。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":498},{"type":"charslot","id":499},{"type":"text","text":"老人舍不得摘下整朵花，颤颤巍巍地采下一片花瓣，放进了那只匣子里。","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"一样旧东西，一样蓝东西，一样借来的东西，现在有了一样新东西。女儿的婚礼用品准备齐全。","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"看到他变得柔和的神色，玛格达尔紧绷的肩膀终于松弛了下来。她若有所思地望着田里仅有的一朵花。","id":502},{"type":"dialog","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":505},{"type":"charslot","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":507},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":508},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":509},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"玛格达尔！嘿嘿，今天没给你带吃的，晚上有时间吗，来我家吃饭吧，帕特尔今天烤羽兽派，老爹的情况也不错，脑子清楚了一些。","id":512,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"好，我一定去。","id":514,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"太好了，我还担心你最近忙得没时间了呢。","id":516,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"嗯，不仅要照顾这里的病人，还要去镇医院的工地帮忙，恨不得把自己分成两半。能逃出来放松一会儿，我求之不得呢。","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":519},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"等镇上的医院造好，这里是不是就可以腾出来了？你......怎么打算？","id":520,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"（低头看看桌子）","id":522,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"花种订购手册......你终于决定要重建花房了吗？","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"嗯，本来就是要重建的。","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"是啊，但以前每次问你的时候，你总说，以后、未来、总有一天。","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":529},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"你总是帮我们的忙，但我们也都期待你也能重新振作起来的。","id":530,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"其实我觉得，等到再次看到你坐在花房里打瞌睡，或是拿着你的剪刀到处修剪的时候，布伦特伍德镇才算回到从前了，哈哈。","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_494_vendla_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛格达尔","text":"谢谢你，贝琳。","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_494_vendla_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝琳","text":"谢我？我什么也没为你做啊，是你帮了我们家太多。","id":536,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":537},{"type":"charslot","id":538},{"type":"text","text":"玛格达尔又记起那片田里的那朵鸢尾，不禁露出微笑。","id":539},{"type":"dialog","id":540},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":541},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":542},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":543},{"type":"character","id":544},{"type":"image","id":545}],"characters":["面带愁容的女士","玛格达尔","贝琳","鬼鬼祟祟的男子","帕特尔","屋里含糊的吼声","老哈利","门内的怒吼","窗外的声音"]}